      <title>3D Autoscan System</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/projects/3d-autoscan/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 15 Jan 2019 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/projects/3d-autoscan/</guid>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;A scanner + rotary platform pipeline that captures arbitrary objects to ~0.1 mm in under five minutes — built to seed a 3D shape database without per-object parameter tuning.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;















&lt;figure  &gt;
  &lt;div class=&#34;flex justify-center	&#34;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;w-100&#34; &gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;Full system photo&#34; srcset=&#34;
               /projects/3d-autoscan/3dscan-system_hu6d484e7b24375fcb8f3d957d31b0d824_11312_2836b2b5f4d9c074730ffff78cccac8e.webp 400w,
               /projects/3d-autoscan/3dscan-system_hu6d484e7b24375fcb8f3d957d31b0d824_11312_44385411534ee89f593f8f42d63b030a.webp 760w,
               /projects/3d-autoscan/3dscan-system_hu6d484e7b24375fcb8f3d957d31b0d824_11312_1200x1200_fit_q80_h2_lanczos_2.webp 1200w&#34;
               src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/projects/3d-autoscan/3dscan-system_hu6d484e7b24375fcb8f3d957d31b0d824_11312_2836b2b5f4d9c074730ffff78cccac8e.webp&#34;
               width=&#34;760&#34;
               height=&#34;282&#34;
               loading=&#34;lazy&#34; data-zoomable /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;

&lt;em&gt;Figure 1. Scanner + rotary platform setup. Controlled by a single PC running the registration pipeline.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;problem&#34;&gt;Problem&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Building a 3D shape database requires scanning many objects. Off-the-shelf scanning is fine for one model, but at database scale it costs human hours: every object shape requires re-tuning algorithm parameters, and every mis-registration eats into the ~5 min/object budget. The need is a robust pipeline that adapts — per-object parameter tuning has to disappear.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;pipeline&#34;&gt;Pipeline&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The system fuses three algorithmic stages tuned to handle scale, reflectance, and pose variation without manual intervention.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;















&lt;figure  &gt;
  &lt;div class=&#34;flex justify-center	&#34;&gt;
    &lt;div class=&#34;w-100&#34; &gt;&lt;img alt=&#34;Frame-to-frame registration&#34; srcset=&#34;
               /projects/3d-autoscan/3dscan-registration_hu0ab9288b3a3023cae94a0f3e53dd0110_4634_bb3e2adf496d7ffd9fb855db56de77c4.webp 400w,
               /projects/3d-autoscan/3dscan-registration_hu0ab9288b3a3023cae94a0f3e53dd0110_4634_eef56101ab7f18c756d1f4d1076bb4ff.webp 760w,
               /projects/3d-autoscan/3dscan-registration_hu0ab9288b3a3023cae94a0f3e53dd0110_4634_1200x1200_fit_q80_h2_lanczos_2.webp 1200w&#34;
               src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/projects/3d-autoscan/3dscan-registration_hu0ab9288b3a3023cae94a0f3e53dd0110_4634_bb3e2adf496d7ffd9fb855db56de77c4.webp&#34;
               width=&#34;555&#34;
