               loading=&#34;lazy&#34; data-zoomable /&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
  &lt;/div&gt;&lt;/figure&gt;

&lt;em&gt;Figure 4. Multi-pose global registration.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Frame-to-frame registration aligns sequential scans on both geometry and texture; an outlier removal stage strips away background noise; finally a global registration pass aligns the multiple platform poses into a coherent model.&lt;/p&gt;
